{
    "name": "玻璃加工",
    "category": "tfg:craftsmanship",
    "icon": "tfc:blowpipe_with_glass",
    "pages": [
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "anchor": "index",
            "text": "$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#intro)玻璃原料$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#lime_and_potash)石灰与钾碱$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#tools)玻璃加工工具$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#blowpipe)吹风管$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#paddle)玻璃压板$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#jacks)玻璃夹钳$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#saw)宝石锯$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#glassworking_steps)玻璃加工步骤$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#table_pour)桌面浇铸$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#basin_pour)盆式浇铸$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#coloring)玻璃染色$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#dyes)染料列表$()"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "anchor": "intro",
            "title": "简介",
            "text": "玻璃工艺是把沙子变为玻璃的艺术。首先，你必须决定制作哪一种$(thing)玻璃原料$()：$(br)$(br) 1、$(thing)二氧化硅玻璃$()：由白沙制成。$(br) 2、$(thing)赤铁矿玻璃$()：由黄沙、红沙或粉红沙制成。$(br) 3、$(thing)橄榄岩玻璃$()：由绿沙或棕沙制成。$(br) 4、$(thing)火山岩玻璃$()：由黑沙制成。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:crafting",
            "recipe": "tfc:crafting/silica_glass_batch",
            "text": "之后就可以用上述任意一种颜色的沙子，加上$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#lime_and_potash)石灰$()和一种$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#lime_and_potash)钾碱$()来合成玻璃原料。$(br)记住，不同种类的沙子可以用锤子敲碎砂砾获得。",
            "title": "二氧化硅玻璃原料"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:smelting",
            "anchor": "lime_and_potash",
            "title": "石灰与钾碱",
            "recipe": "tfg:smelting/dried_seaweed_to_soda",
            "text": "$(item)海草灰$()或$(item)硝石$()都可以作为$(thing)钾碱$()的来源。海草灰是一种粉末，由加热$(thing)干海草$()或$(thing)海带$()制成。$(br2)$(item)石灰$()则由加热$(item)助焊剂$()获得。",
            "recipe2": "tfg:smelting/lime"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "anchor": "tools",
            "text": "玻璃加工从一份玻璃原料开始，然后完成一系列步骤。这些步骤可能需要特定的工具：$(br)$(li)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#blowpipe)吹风管$()，用于$(thing)吹制$()和$(thing)拉伸$()。$(li)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#paddle)玻璃压板$()，用于$(thing)压平$()。$(li)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#jacks)玻璃夹钳$()，用于$(thing)捏夹$()。$(li)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#saw)宝石锯$()，用于$(thing)锯切$()。$(li)还有一块$(l:agriculture/weaving)羊毛布$()，用于$(thing)滚压$()。",
            "title": "必备工具"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "anchor": "blowpipe",
            "title": "吹风管",
            "item": "tfc:ceramic/unfired_blowpipe,tfc:ceramic_blowpipe,tfc:blowpipe",
            "text": "最重要的工具是$(thing)吹风管$()。$(item)未烧制的吹风管$()可以用粘土$(thing)塑形$()得到，再烧制成$(thing)陶瓷吹风管$()。$(br)不过陶瓷吹风管很脆弱，使用时有概率损坏。不会损坏的$(item)吹风管$()可以在砧上$(l:craftsmanship/anvils#working)锻造$()$(thing)黄铜棒$()得到。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:crafting",
            "anchor": "paddle",
            "title": "玻璃压板",
            "recipe": "tfc:crafting/paddle",
            "text": "$(thing)玻璃压板$()可以用来将玻璃$(thing)压平$()，可用木材制作。"
        },
        {
            "type": "tfg:welding_recipe",
            "anchor": "jacks",
            "title": "玻璃夹钳",
            "recipe": "tfc:welding/jacks",
            "text": "$(thing)捏夹$()操作需要用$(thing)玻璃夹钳$()完成，它是把一根黄铜棒与一块黄铜薄板$(l:craftsmanship/anvils#welding)焊接$()制成的。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:crafting",
            "anchor": "saw",
            "title": "宝石锯",
            "recipe": "tfc:crafting/gem_saw",
            "text": "$(thing)锯切$()操作需要用$(item)宝石锯$()完成。宝石锯也可用来敲碎$(item)玻璃方块$()和$(item)玻璃板$()以获取它们。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "anchor": "glassworking_steps",
            "text": "首先，吹风管上的玻璃必须加热到至少$(4)$(bold)淡红$()。然后，把吹风管拿在$(thing)副手$()，长按$(item)$(k:key.use)$()即可执行每一步$()。$(br)用$(item)$(k:key.swapOffhand)$()可以把滚烫的吹风管换到副手上。$(br2)$(bold)吹制$()$(br)面朝正前方使用$(thing)吹风管$()。$(br2)$(bold)拉伸$()$(br)面朝正下方使用$(thing)吹风管$()。",
            "title": "如何加工玻璃"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "$(bold)压平$()$(br)使用$(thing)吹风管$()的同时主手拿着$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#paddle)玻璃压板$()。$(br2)$(bold)捏夹$()$(br)使用$(thing)吹风管$()的同时主手拿着$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#jacks)玻璃夹钳$()。$(br2)$(bold)锯切$()$(br)使用$(thing)吹风管$()的同时主手拿着$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#saw)宝石锯$()。$(br2)$(bold)滚压$()$(br)使用$(thing)吹风管$()的同时主手拿着$(l:agriculture/weaving)羊毛布$()。"
        },
        {
